  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "效率魔方 · 格式转换、画册联系表与切图工坊套件": "Forge Studio · Batch Converter, Contact Sheet & Sprite Suite",
      "面向设计师、摄影师与游戏美术的一站式离线批量生产套件：集「格式魔方」（批量压图、WebP/JPEG/PNG/多帧 ICO 转换、游戏贴图 POT 对齐与音视频 FFmpeg 转码/调色板 GIF/响度统一）、「画册与联系表工坊」（长图无缝拼接、暗房联系表与原生多页中文 PDF 画册）、「切图与精灵图工坊」（九宫格/自定义网格切图、透明空瓦片跳过与游戏 POT Sprite Sheet 合图/TexturePacker & CSS 坐标表）于一体，并可选联动图形审计、画师精审与矢量/PSD 工坊形成全链路闭环。": "All-in-one offline batch production suite for designers, photographers, and game artists: unites Format Forge (batch image optimization, WebP/JPEG/PNG/multi-size ICO, POT texture alignment & FFmpeg video/audio transcoding, palette GIF, EBU R128 loudnorm), Sheet Studio (seamless long-image stitching, darkroom contact sheets & native multi-page PDF albums), and Sprite Slicer (grid slicing, transparent-tile skipping & POT Sprite Sheets with TexturePacker/CSS coordinates), optionally paired with Image Audit, Loupe Viewer, SVG Studio, and PSD Studio.",
      "效率魔方 · 批转、画册与切图": "Forge Studio · Convert, Sheets & Sprites",
      "轻量聚焦的生产力工作台：启用格式魔方（图片/视频/音频批量转换与压图）、画册与联系表工坊（长图拼接/暗房联系表/PDF 画册）、切图与精灵图工坊（九宫格切图与游戏 Sprite Sheet）以及色板、标签、评分、笔记与表格配套工具，开箱即可高速批处理素材。": "Focused batch production workspace enabling Format Forge (image/video/audio conversion & compression), Sheet Studio (stitching, contact sheets & PDF albums), and Sprite Slicer (grid slicing & game sprite sheets) alongside palette, tags, rating, notes, and table companions.",
      "全能制作工坊 · 批转 + 画册 + 切图 + 审计 + 精审": "Forge Pro · Convert + Sheets + Sprites + Audit + Loupe",
      "在效率魔方基础上叠加图形审计（POT/EXIF/AI 咒语/直方图）、画师精审看图与对比台、矢量图标工坊与 PSD 图层工坊。右侧智能上下文容器常驻「色彩审计」与「筛选」，主区附「非 POT 贴图检查」视图，打通「审计发现问题 → 格式魔方批量转正 → 画册/切图交付」全链路闭环。": "Full production workbench adding Image Audit (POT/EXIF/AI prompts/histograms), Loupe Viewer, SVG Vector Studio, and PSD Layer Studio, with Color Audit and Non-POT Texture Inspection views forming a complete audit-to-delivery pipeline.",
